---
import type { Lang } from "../../lib/i18n";
import { local } from "./shared";
import { serviceSplitText } from "./service-split";
interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const t = local(lang),
  s = serviceSplitText(lang);
---

<section data-demo="microservices" lang={lang}>
  <header>
    <p class="eyebrow">{s.fiction}</p>
    <h2>
      {t(
        "One capability can release alone",
        "기능 하나만 독립 배포",
        "一つの機能だけをリリース",
      )}
    </h2>
    <p data-fixture>{s.fixture}</p>
    <p class="change" data-change>
      {s.change}
    </p>
  </header>
  <p class="condition" data-contract>
    {t(
      "Compatible contract: only Library needs a new release.",
      "호환 계약 유지: 보관함만 새 배포 필요.",
      "契約の互換性を維持：新しいリリースはライブラリのみ。",
    )}
  </p>
  <ol class="services">
    {[s.catalog, s.library, s.billing].map((name, index) => (
      <li
        data-deployment
        data-service={
          index === 0 ? "catalog" : index === 1 ? "library" : "billing"
        }
      >
        <p class="unit">
          {s.unit} · {index + 1}
        </p>
        <h3>{name}</h3>
        <strong class="version" data-version>
          {index === 1 ? "v1 → v2" : "v1 → v1"}
        </strong>
        <p class="behavior">{index === 1 ? s.tagAdded : s.unchanged}</p>
        <div class="store" data-store>
          <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
          <strong>{t("Owned store", "자체 저장소", "所有する保存先")}</strong>
          <span>{name}</span>
        </div>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>
  <div class="network" data-communication>
    <h3>
      {t(
        "Network lookup · before the tag write",
        "네트워크 조회 · 태그 쓰기 이전",
        "ネットワーク参照 · タグの書き込み前",
      )}
    </h3>
    <p class="request">
      {s.library} → {s.catalog} API
    </p>
    <p>
      {t(
        "A remote return is not guaranteed. Billing is outside this lookup path.",
        "원격 응답은 보장되지 않습니다. 결제는 이 조회 경로에 참여하지 않습니다.",
        "遠隔応答は保証されません。課金はこの参照経路に参加しません。",
      )}
    </p>
  </div>
  <ol class="outcomes" data-outcomes>
    <li data-success>
      <h3>{t("1 · Success", "1 · 성공", "1 · 成功")}</h3>
      <p data-result="success">{s.success}</p>
    </li>
    <li data-timeout>
      <h3>
        {t(
          "2 · Catalog lookup timeout",
          "2 · 카탈로그 조회 시간 초과",
          "2 · カタログ参照タイムアウト",
        )}
      </h3>
      <p data-result="failure">{s.failure}</p>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <p class="boundary" data-boundary>
    {t(
      "Each service owns its data; no direct reads of another service's tables. Independent releases still need monitoring and failure handling; downstream failures can propagate.",
      "각 서비스가 데이터를 소유하며 다른 서비스 테이블을 직접 읽지 않습니다. 독립 배포에도 관측·장애 처리가 필요하며 의존 서비스의 장애가 전파될 수 있습니다.",
      "各サービスがデータを所有し、他サービスのテーブルを直接読みません。独立リリースでも監視と障害処理が必要で、依存先の障害は波及し得ます。",
    )}
  </p>
  <p class="footnote">{s.storeNote}</p>
</section>
<style>
  section {
    container-type: inline-size;
    padding: clamp(16px, 4vw, 28px);
    color: #4c362a;
    background: #f8f0e8;
    border: 1px solid #a28c78;
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.5;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  p,
  h2,
  h3,
  ol {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    color: #4c362a;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 3vw, 1.65rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0.7rem;
  }
  h3 {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .change {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .condition {
    border-left: 4px solid #86603e;
    padding-left: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 650;
  }
  .services {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.8rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }
  .services > li {
    border: 2px dotted #947150;
    padding: 0.8rem;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .unit {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .version {
    display: inline-block;
    border: 1px solid #947150;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    margin: 0.7rem 0;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-family: monospace;
  }
  [data-service="library"] .version {
    border: 2px solid #4c362a;
    background: #f5e1c8;
  }
  .behavior {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .store {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.1rem;
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .store strong {
    border-top: 1px solid #947150;
    padding-top: 0.6rem;
  }
  .network {
    border-top: 2px dashed #947150;
    border-bottom: 2px dashed #947150;
    padding: 0.8rem 0;
  }
  .network p {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
  }
  .network .request {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .outcomes {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }
  .outcomes li {
    border: 1px solid #a28c78;
    border-left: 4px solid #86603e;
    padding: 0.8rem;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .outcomes [data-timeout] {
    border-left-style: dashed;
  }
  .outcomes p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .boundary {
    border-top: 1px solid #a28c78;
    padding-top: 0.8rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .footnote {
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }
  @container (max-width: 520px) {
    .services,
    .outcomes {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  @media (forced-colors: active) {
    .condition,
    .services > li,
    .version,
    [data-service="library"] .version,
    .store strong,
    .network,
    .outcomes li,
    .boundary {
      border-color: CanvasText;
    }
  }
</style>
